{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116144002869-1116_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261116144831\"/><p>網傳克里米亞大橋交通中斷。</p><p>克里米亞地區行政首長阿克肖諾夫周一（16日）指，烏克蘭襲擊了克里米亞大橋，導致交通中斷。</p><p>克里米亞大橋全長19公里，是公路、鐵路兩用橋，東起俄羅斯克拉斯諾達爾邊疆區塔曼半島，西至克里米亞半島的刻赤市。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:13:59.293340+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:42.158457+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T07:07:36.684066+00:00","content_hash":"ffd692bd69874df881cc2d8e3130877c8d88d863b7d6cd71ca690c2ca4c5c3fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}